    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkīma nchīlwa na jūbba ya maguta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkīma nebe walī nke o ng'wa ūmò wa bahangi ūja kūnīlīīla ū Elisha alīhaya, “Ū ngoshi wane ū ntūmami wako wazumalīkile, alīyo nū bebe ng'weneklīllī ūmanile ūmo walī ang'ogohelile ū SEEBA. Gwike ī haha alīho munhū ūyo wantondaga būgasa ū ngoshi wane, alīhaya kwiza kūbasola a bitūnja bane abajane bakabize basese bakwe!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūmūja, “Na lūūlū ī gīsī nadūgije kūkūgunanha mu kinehe? Niwīlage īsho ūlīnasho ū mu kaya yako.” Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūhaya, “Ū nsese wako atī na kīnhū shose shose, ūlū ītī ka jūbba kamò dūhū ka tūguta!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Elisha ūng'wīla, “Bīta bītaga ū mu bazenganwa biyo, ūje ūkūlandaga shiseme shilī dalali; landaga shingī, yaya ū kūgelela kūlanda shigehu dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma wingīle mu kaya wilugalīle na a bitūnja bako; hūna wandye kūgasaamya a maguta kūfuma ū mu jūbba kūgatūūla ū mu shiseme shenīsho, būlī shene īsho shokala washitūūla ha mhūjo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wīnga hoi ūūkīīta ūmo akalagīīlīlwa; wilugalīla mu kaya na a bitūnja bakwe, bandya kūyūng'wenhela ī shiseme wagasaamīja a maguta ū mu shiseme shenīsho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūshisha shokala pyī ī shiseme shabo, aho wahaya, “Enhaga shingī ī shiseme,” ū nyanda ūhaya, “Shashila ī shiseme;” a maguta gooya ū kūsūlūlūka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūja kūng'wīla ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu, nang'hwe ūng'wīla, “Jaga ūkajinje a maguta ūlīpe ū būgasa wako; ayo galasaage ūtūmamīle.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nkīma ngūmba kūbyala ng'wana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwise lūmò ū Elisha ūja Shunemu, walīho nkīma nsabi ūng'wegeleja kūlya shilīwa ha ng'wakwe. Kwandīja henaho būlī makanza ūlū wajaga ī mhandī ja kwenūko ūyūshikīla henaho wapandīka shilīwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza ilebe ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ūng'wīla ū ngoshi, “Bebe ū munhū ūyo akwizaga aha būlī makanza nalībona ū munhū ng'wenūyo alī ng'wela, o ng'wa Mulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tūmeegejage ka chumba ka malīngīīla ū kwigūlya ya numba, tūntūūlīle mo na būlīīlī, meeza, isumbī, na tala; apandīke ha kwikala ūlū wizaga kūtūgeniha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lūngī wahayiza ho hangī ū Elisha, ūlinha ū kū chumba shakwe wigoloola kwifuula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūng'wīla ū Gehazi ū ntūmami wakwe, “Bebe aling'witanage ū nkīma ū Nshunemu iize aha.” Ūng'witana wiza wīmīīla ū kū būtongi wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Elisha ūng'wīla ū ntūmami wakwe, “Ng'wīlage gīkī, ‘Ūkūtwītīlaga mihayo mitaale shido, hīmba a bise ūlū kūkwītīla mhayo kī ū gwa kūkūgunanha ū bebe? Tūkūlombele mhayo gose gose ū kūlī ntemi nūūlū hamo kūlī ntaale wa bashilikale?’” Nang'hwe ūshosha, “Baba ū nene natī na makoye, nguno nalī ha gatī ya banhū bane!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūmūja ū Gehazi, “Ūlībona kinehe ū bebe, ūlū kwītīlwa mhayo kī?” Na ng'hwe ūhaya; “Ū nene nalībona atī na ng'wana, alīyo ū ngoshi wakūlaga.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū Elsha ūhaya, “Ng'witanage ho hangī.” Ūng'witana, wiza wīmīīla ha nyango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūng'wīla, “Ha ng'waka makanza gītī genaya ūkūlela na makono gako ng'wana nyanda.” Ū nkīma ūshosha alīhaya, “Ii baba, yaya ī gīko. Munhū o ng'wa Mulungu, lekaga ū kūmpūgūla gīko ū ntūmami wako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū nkīma ng'wenūyo ū kū ng'waka ūbūūcha nda, ū ng'wikanza gītī lyenīlo ūbyala ng'wana ngosha, gīt'ūmo Elisha akang'wīlīla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nyanda ūkūla; alīyo lūshikū lūmò walī waja na ise kū ngūnda kū bagesi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwimanīla wang'wīla ū ise, “Baba ntwe! Baba, ntwe!” Ū ise ūng'wīla ntūmami ūmò waho, “Mūchage ūntwale kūlī nina!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntūmami ng'wenūyo ūmūūcha ūntwala ū kūlī nina; ū nina ūnela ha magūlū gakwe, ī līīmi aho lyashika ntwe gatī; ū nīgīni ng'wenūyo ūzumalīka! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nina ūmūūcha ūlinha nang'hwe ū kū chumba sha ng'wa munhū o ng'wa Mulungu, ūshika ūnalīkīja a ha būlīīlī wakwe. Hūna ūfuma mo, ūgūlugala ū nyango.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Elisha kūnjūūcha nyanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ūng'witana ū ngoshi ūng'wīla, “Nalīlomba ūnitūmīle ūmò wa batūmami aha, anenhele na nzobe, naje ū kūlī munhū o ng'wa Mulungu natūdīīla ū kūshoka.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmūja, “Nibūlī ūje koi lelo? Īkī shitī shigukulu sha ng'weji mpya, nūūlū ītī Sabato!” Nang'hwe ūshosha ūhaya, “Mm ndūhū makoye!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wamala ū kwīgolanya ī nzobe, hūna ūng'wīla ū ntūmami, “Ihuutage nīyo yaya ū kwīdoonhisha ūlū natakūwīlile.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ūja ū kū lūgūlū lwa Kalimeli ūko wikalaga ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu. Ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu ūnoleela ataalī kūle ūng'wīla ū ntūmami wakwe ū Gehazi, “Ūūyo wiza ū nkīma wa Shunemu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Peelaga koi ūnsūng'wanhe ūkamūje, ‘Ūlī mhola? Nū ngoshi wako alī mhola? Al'ū ng'wana wing'we alī mhola nang'hwe?’” Ū nkīma ūshosha, “Mm mhola dūhū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho washikīīla a halī munhū o ng'wa Mulungu ū kū lūgūlū lwa Kalimeli, ūshikīla kūgwa mu magūlū gakwe ūndimīīla; ū Gehazi wangūha gīkī ang'wīnje hoi, alīyo ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu ūnemeja alīhaya, “Nekage wapīnīhalaga alī na makoye, alīyo ū SEEBA wanibisaga ataalī ū kunoolekeja, nūūlū kūniwīla ni nguno kī.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma ng'wenūyo wandya kūhaya, “Baba nakalomba ng'wana ū nene ūyū? Natakūwīlile gīkī, ‘Lekaga ū kūnipūgūla?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūng'wīla ū Gehazi, “Gwitungage ū ng'wenda gwako ūgwibbaate gūdaame, hūna ūgūsole ū nanhga gwane ūpeele koi; nūūlū ūmanhya na munhū ū mu nzīla yaya ū kūngīsha; hama nūūlū ose ose ūkūgīsha yaya ū kūng'widīka. Ūlū ūshika gūlaajage ū nang'ha gwane a ha būshū wa nyanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū nina wa nyanda ūhaya, “Ūmo SEEBA alī mpanga, na gīt'ūmo bebe ūlī mpanga, natūkūlekaga.” Na lūūlū ūbūka ūja hamò nang'hwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Gehazi ūtongela, ūūkashika ūgūlaaja ū nang'ha a ha būshū wa nyanda, alīyo atafunije ilaka lyose lyose. Ū Gehazi aho wabona gīko ūnyamuka kūnsūng'wanha ū Elisha, ūng'wīla, “Ū nyanda atamishije.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wahayūshika ū Elisha, ūmona ū nīgīnī alaalile a ha būlīīlī wakwe wachaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wingīla ūlugala ū nyango, wilugalīla mumo hamò nang'hwe, ūnomba ū SEEBA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūlinha a ha būlīīlī ūlaala a higūlya ya nyanda, nomo kū nomo, miso kū miso, makono kū makono. Aho wigoloola a higūlya ya nyanda, ū mīlī gwakwe gwandya kūlūngūja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūbūūka hoi ūyeela yeela ū mu chumba, ūshoka hangī a ha būlīīlī, wigoloola hangī a higūlya yakwe. Kwimanīla ū nyanda wityamucha ng'hangala pungatī, hūna ūloleecha a miso gakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūng'witana ū Gehazi ūng'wīla, “Ng'witanage ū nkīma ū Nshunemu.” Ūng'witana; aho wiza ūng'wīla, “Ūyū ū ng'witūnja wako!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mayū ng'wenūyo aho wingīla ū mu kaya, winama ū kū būtongi wakwe kūshisha hasī. Hūna ūnsola ū ng'witūnja wakwe ūfuma hanze.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilīwa kwīngījiwa būlūlū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūshoka Giligaali; ū mu nzengo gwenūyo yūsangwa yagwiile mo nzala. Ū ng'wikanza lyenīlo a bahangi bikuminga kūhooya nang'hwe; hūna ūng'wīla ū ntūmami wakwe, “Ītūūlage ha moto ī nengelo ī nhaale ūbasībūkīje nūūlū makūbī balye a banhū benaba.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūmò wabo ūja kūlola makūbī mu malaale; ūūkapandīka itina ly'isīndī līlī na matwajo. Ūtonagūla masīndī ūgabunga mu ng'wenda wenha wiza ūgapandagūla ūgaponeja ū mu nengelo yenīyo gūpogoma, nūūlū īkī walī atīho ūyo walī agamanile gīkī gadūgije ū kūliiwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A banhū būsabūlīlwa ī shilīwa shenīsho, aho bagema ū kagalya, būlīla balīhaya, “Baba munhū o ng'wa Mulungu, lūlīmo lūfu ū mu nengelo!” Būlemeelwa ū kūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Elisha ūhaya, “Nenhelagi būsu būgeehu.” Ūbūponeja ū mu nengelo ya shilīwa, hūna ūhaya, “Basabūlīlagi lūūlū a banhū balye.” Gūbiza gashila a makoye ū mu nengelo yenīyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.41"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūlisha banhū igana",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū wiza kūfuma Bali-shalisha, ūng'wenhela ū munhū o ng'wa Mulungu migatī makūmi abīlī ya būsu wa būsīga; ya kūfuma mu matwajo ga kwandya ga būsīga bokwe, na mangala ga masha ga būsīga mu fuko. Ū Elisha ūhaya, “Batengelage a banhū balye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ntūmami wakwe ūhaya, “Ī shilīwa shilī gīkī nadūgije kūbatengela banhū igana!” Alīyo ū Elisha ūhaya hangī, “Batengelage a banhū balye. Nguno ū SEEBA alīhaya gīkī, ‘Bakūlya bigeje balekeele na kūlekeela’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 4:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbatengela ng'hana, būlya kūshisha būlekeela shingī, gīt'ūmo gūkahayīla mhayo go ng'wa SEEBA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.4.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.4.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
